{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6b6ac4ab5ab70a37edf7a047869cc1c305fa5a9785b6da477d5b1712ec329e26","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8849bb7ec4de53aa2439a9ebc0342cc378621d15f8dde3a5d6f78dfd1c6055c4","logical_entry_identity":"110fc9d394220cf3ad6780d7d3648361865b95cdb9ec5b2307e6203facfb7b11","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Lecture on Humility by Archmage Linaniil","source_tag":"_t","target":"大法师莱娜尼尔关于谦卑的演讲"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"44d86330bcde781106f1204eed8e21f433d3079087747d2d0c29b660f68d30c6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"884b7916aa1736c5c8bcdf630075216889500609b789506063fcf3dddb2fb4a4","logical_entry_identity":"57dbe37ef8e5d495d66f449a6de84e54e91b2f112d981fa101bdacde86ccdc6b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*For the first time you've seen, genuine pleasure lights up the halfling's soot-smeared face.*#WHITE#\nGOOD WORK, WHOEVER YOU ARE. ALL OF MAJ'EYAL OWES YOU THEIR THANKS, EXCEPT FOR MEMBERS OF THE BROTHERHOOD OF ALCHEMISTS, WHO MIGHT TRY TO DO YOU BODILY HARM. FORTUNATELY FOR YOU, THEY'RE MOSTLY HARMLESS.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*你第一次看到，半身人满是煤灰的脸上绽放出了诚恳的笑容。*#WHITE#\n干的好！不管你是谁！整个马基·埃亚尔都应该感谢你，除了那些炼金术士兄弟会成员，他们想加害于你。不过幸运的是，那些货通常来说根本伤不到你。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"346839e8eb0a0e544392623b7cfe9f912cac823b812484f9f2b9faf63700ead6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"884b983e436f727ece9bf53ea123f5da4b7018fe47ea31747593f3bb03a11a2c","logical_entry_identity":"17b36f485ad57329c0edb4f194a3571984e3299d8e18ecbc708287b06defc927","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# exudes antimagic forces.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#散发出反魔法的力量。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e54b94720301b0aea75e7d7c5b2fcb062d5b6e31b29e75d4de552900584ec040","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"884e4d5f1a68746a24e3ad8ee9659356fae7888a4dd572c19ff3cdfca6a578e6","logical_entry_identity":"479beb961ebdfdda6bfa48fdb233ce9deb6ae479900334e3a6481bca098da753","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Crooked","source_tag":"_t","target":"扭曲"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7b62f72b402e40b0ea2f0e17a3e4b9e913159ddfae58ae607b15547b8dc60eb6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8852c2e5d595371c03fd0b544b0abc58acb9c2b44fcac7a0c15b7b11c77d2838","logical_entry_identity":"2db85b2cbbb36d756f189723e638e0f616f879b1d1c503414d43c2a08c0580ee","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Stun immunity chance#LAST#\nThis represents your chance to completely avoid being stunned, dazed, or frozen.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#震慑免疫#LAST#\n表示你完全免疫震慑、眩晕或者冰冻的几率。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"10c3859f7d65e3083e185ed53a23866d51fc60fc606879c7dc52bd51fd284733","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"88536f1e0784029e0551eb096c60701559f8ea8357524e713f0ca93db7aaa2b7","logical_entry_identity":"f309478b945b47919d5ecf1d0a262cbea7adab9eeaa25a216f109441b09bdb6c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"An elf dressed in glowing robes.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一位穿着荧光长袍的精灵。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"455aecef94cdf78ccfabe1b84cb39aca22415ab6509160d3147611e146fe1f14","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8869c772eece02d7512deffa6783c15700738c1328c5ebf5903cd1842cf3c44f","logical_entry_identity":"1d0ff85ff8572a4d2912ce0fae6437e008da2dd1a2ee25e7a1fc633fdd7882a0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"elixir of focus","source_tag":"_t","target":"专注药剂"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ba6ca8f41b54821f597b2b85300de83757e04c62d18f702f10c00bf3219e64bd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"886bd1e543ee07de596bdab80c9bcf531d2a74c1fb94a972fa8f65490517a27f","logical_entry_identity":"c6c24b87c20ce7b2349df02177a81ddceb972d2b2c6776920636b054b17e027a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"During your adventures you will find quests.\nA quest can come from performing an action, finding an item, speaking to somebody, and more.\n\nYou can view your current quests by pressing 'j' or right-clicking yourself.\n\nOnce a quest is finished or failed it will disappear from the quest log. Most quests in ToME are optional, if you don't think you can survive one, don't do it.\n\nWhen this tutorial started you were tasked to kill the Lone Wolf, you are nearing its position.\n#GOLD#Beware and fight with honour!#WHITE#\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"在游戏过程中你会接到各种任务。\n任务可能来自执行某个动作、找到一件物品、与某人交谈等等。\n\n你可以按下 'j'键或右键点击你自己来查看当前获得的任务。\n\n当任务完成或者失败，会从任务列表消失。ToME4中大多数任务是可选的。假如你觉得\n自己无法活着完成某个任务，就不要去做。\n\n教程开始时，你接到的任务是杀死孤狼；你已经接近它的位置了。\n#GOLD#小心，并光明正大地战斗！#WHITE#\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1f799494f052a244fd164591ae0b1d1f9e8b37cbfaaa5b2388e376c141a65f9a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"886c687afe98ca09687386f0cefd1990391d628d0fbe4a62d42ec0f99af4912b","logical_entry_identity":"10eba9b4f182f75863377f4a9008397034ba11a7cf4dccac6268238cccf47a36","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Flameshock","source_tag":"talent name","target":"火焰冲击"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2420f703bcd849febb5e3ece5a2af3d5d1adbbd784c0b40e8b446732035d2e3d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"887124d1972eea6ef24af7e2697655fdb99c2f0120e07746a00e41bfd80e223f","logical_entry_identity":"8f09bb12f07bba09b5e3c5a01c604754c45ec789e9c60cf00e97f66b89984daa","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Bear Trap","source_tag":"_t","target":"+捕熊陷阱"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d07665243ec4f37d3708706befce15c1354150ae2baba498024f2abd6ffa82e6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"8872a96c0ecf87d4ec376c885fd9768f3e8f88b8675f33969b8908005563bdd1","logical_entry_identity":"2e84474006c1c69a83df5d28b86f4a41d278ad3ef5f8851f95ec2c91bb39a3d4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Shield usage training","source_tag":"_t","target":"盾牌使用训练"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"aeb8f3c0b830a697a76a03aa85807a49b38e7f5daed20faadce472fc9b351311","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"88810c68f9ca45c46e6cf2062c7834cf889d260a1